  "about": [
    "I am a passionate and future-focused Mechanical Engineering student, currently developing my expertise in modern engineering tools, AI-driven solutions and sustainable technology.",
    "Alongside my studies I ran small ventures — Adhunik Path, an online book shop that started in February 2025 as LEXO BookShop, and Adhunik Style, a fashion brand — and worked part-time as a computer specialist at New Xpressway. All three ended in May 2026. I still promote products as a Rokomari.com affiliate. This work has given me hands-on experience in sales, branding, digital marketing and customer service.",
    "I enjoy solving real-world problems with technology, creativity and structured thinking, and I use AI tools such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Grok, Copilot, Claude and Lovable in my work. My goal is a career that combines engineering, innovation and entrepreneurship.",
    "I am currently exploring Mechanical Engineering, Product Development, AI Productivity & Automation, Sustainability & Green Technology, and Business Strategy & Branding — and I am open to internships, global opportunities and collaborations."
